                            <comment id="12890978" author="tdunning" created="Thu, 22 Jul 2010 00:57:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Here is a patch with an object that estimates the five quartiles, mean and standard deviation.  The associated tests indicate that it is pretty much as accurate as if all of the samples were kept and the empirical rank statistics were computed directly.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
